[EN] Blocks approval while discharge_permit_extension is not "applied", "granted" or "not required" – only when einleitung_vorhanden (this sheet) is confirmed. §5.4.1 (p. 45): discharge permits expire regularly "and must be extended or re-applied for in good time". §5.4.3 (p. 46) recommends ("sollte") clarifying the requirements with the water authority at least two years before expiry.$m$,
